{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act13side_level_act13side_09_beg",
  "groupId": "act13side",
  "stageId": "act13side_09",
  "title": "叹息",
  "storyCode": "NL-9",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_09_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e6c147b35c96763f346de5756e4a776cba72bcd74e49c604839cb91a12ab1b8b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔2-9-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G09"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "砾",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好消息，博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "砾",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "监正会同意罗德岛各位的外出申请了，“让重要的合作伙伴游览城市也是必要的”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "砾",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本来，如果没有这一系列事件发生的话，您可以在大骑士领更自由一些的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士？您找我们吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！骑士姐姐！正好我还有剩下的健康餐，你打包带回家吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "砾",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......您好，砾小姐，博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "难得有机会去卡西米尔的其他地方参观。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "想不想出去逛逛？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "休——假——时——间——",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G01"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "激烈的战斗！让人不敢相信自己的眼睛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不对！应该说，一位名不见经传的梦魇！首次闯入特锦赛，竟然就能与冠军分庭抗礼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鲜红的铠甲在赛场上碰撞，让今夜的月光也黯然失色！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用说，我想观众也感受到了，拓拉！“草原之恐”逐魇骑士！他那疯狂的意志令人为之着迷沉醉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "经历了与耀骑士的那场决斗之后，人气居高不下的逐魇骑士！究竟能不能为他成为大骑士的故事中，再添一笔！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "顺带一提，古代人娱乐公司正在举行“骑士封号有奖竞猜”！凡是能猜中骑士封号的观众，都能获得精美礼品一份！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的气势哪里去了？梦魇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "米诺斯人......在我的同胞鞭笞往日的时代，你们的英雄已经沦为了诗人口中的典故......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "废话啰嗦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你的可汗如今在哪儿？你那些引以为豪的同胞活在大地何处？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一个活在过去的梦魇，一个可怜人罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......米诺斯人，感染者，你为什么而战？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "生存。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们把我奉为感染者的英雄......把我当做历史的标杆，但我的初衷，仅仅是活着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......感染者的英雄？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来如此......你也在为你的同胞而战吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "同胞......？不，我们并无血缘，也没有相同的故乡，我们只是不幸患上了同一种疾病而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们的遭遇令我感到悲悯，所以我去拯救他们，为所有人寻觅出路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是同胞......你却还要，拯救他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......可笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的确强大......但是，卡西米尔的草原难道已经被感染者和异国人瓜分了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡西米尔人，库兰塔，他们在哪儿！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道我千里迢迢来到骑士之国，是为了和感染者、米诺斯人和自己的同族决斗的吗！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——奇耻大辱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G07"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇哇哇......这、这里就是卡西米尔的商业中心吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "砾",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "严格来说，这里只是大骑士领大小数百个商业中心中的一个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "砾",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为距离比较近，所以我推荐来这里罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是垃圾食品是不是太多了！我一眼看过去，视野里就有三家爆米花店、两家披萨店和四家汉堡店哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是不行的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊哈哈......因为这附近有一座骑士竞技场吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "砾",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然。竞技场算是每一个商业圈的核心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "砾",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "围绕着骑士们的厮杀拓展商业，就是这么一回事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这是......临光的玩偶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！好可爱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......等等，这家店，难道全是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哟，几位客人，是耀骑士的粉丝？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你可来对地方啦，这里是耀骑士周边专卖！黏土小人、毛绒玩偶、临光家族徽章应有尽有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "顺便一提，如果耀骑士能打败风骑士再度进入决赛，供货商还考虑制作精炼源石雕刻纪念品！现在可以先付定金哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正耀骑士一定会赢嘛！哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "(替夜莺买一个玩偶。)",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "店主",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "谢谢惠顾！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "(询问定金是多少。)",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "店主",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "是——啊，您是用外币结算的吗？龙门币？那您可能还得先去一趟银行。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "店主",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我帮你换算一下，大概一百三十万龙门币左右吧？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "(反问对方耀骑士用过的盾牌能不能当做镇店之宝。)",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "店主",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "盾牌？耀骑士什么时候用过盾牌？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "店主",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "不过，我们这里有战锤、双刃剑和最新的剑枪模型。您要不看看？"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G08"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难舍难分！逐魇骑士的一击凌厉攻击再度被血骑士挡下，而冠军就像是切开豆腐般，将人工地形夷为平地！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "时间已经过去了十分钟！风暴般的交锋仍在继续！究竟是谁，会在这仿佛永不停歇的攻击中展露疲态！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——说话间！冠军再次使用了法术！躲过了对手的一记扫击！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道双方还在小心翼翼地试探对方吗！？冠军与梦魇，至今还没人主动施放自己的源石技艺——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G01"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......米诺斯人，你受过怎样的训练？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很遗憾，在成为骑士之前，我并没有经历过像样的战斗训练。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "成为骑士之后，也只是边打边学。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......天生的战士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "年轻人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是你的导师，但是，如果你渴望一个对手，我可以教你一件事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虚张声势的恐惧，对任何一个努力活在当下的人来说，都毫无意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "血骑士后退了半步。\n鲜血渗出他的铠甲，在空中凝聚成流。\n红光包裹在他的武器上，就像审判的利刃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回答我，梦魇，在你梦里的历史中，在那上千年前至今的历史之中——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可曾有感染者的丁点生机？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别感到怯懦，梦魇！自称怯薛的梦魇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的可汗在哪！让他上前来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G01"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耀骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的可汗在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G05"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的可汗在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_county_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "可汗的历史已经过去上千年了。\n你只能在历史书上找到他，孩子。\n怯薛？那些人是可汗的侍从，他们是这片大地上最勇武的战士。\n可汗征服过很多地方，但是，也干过许多伤害他人的事情。\n散播恐惧是梦魇的天性，征服欲几乎是可汗的食粮。\n但是呢，拓拉。\n你生在这片大地之上，你会找到你自己的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G01"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......父亲，劲敌，导师，理想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我竟然......试图在这座城市寻找这些？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不！梦该醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这只是留念，我为自己画下的天途的道路，早有注定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祷告结束了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的家人都死了。我的同族都迷失了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——可汗就在我的刀尖之上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——就是我自己的可汗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G05"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......天气，晴。无风日，适合射箭的日子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "目标，罗德岛领袖两人，种族不明的头罩人，还有一个卡特斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "心情......很糟糕。因为每一次都有人妨碍工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......补充，心情非常糟糕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有写日记的习惯吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁会故意留下这些东西，送给监正会帮忙定罪吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那看来，你是个会把个人情绪带入工作的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......赦罪师，耀骑士，还有那个给人感觉很古怪的卡特斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛到底是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前一直没有机会问问你们......你们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从哪里听到“赦罪师”这个名字的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "莫妮克不是没有见过面前的萨卡兹出手。\n出色的剑术，夹杂着一些无法理解的源石技艺，也许是巫术，和耀骑士一起挡住了玄铁一箭。\n她心底里其实想过，也许那时候的“出手阻拦”还不是这个萨卡兹的全部面貌。\n但是现在，她确信了一件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我没可能告诉你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也没有心慈手软到，目睹一个杀手对博士和阿米娅张弓搭箭，还能放她走的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "加上，之前的招呼，我们似乎没有还礼，有失礼仪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......辉光......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "耀骑士的同伴，都喜欢这么闪亮亮的吗？我都审美疲劳了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（很温和......甚至感觉不到攻击性......萨卡兹的巫术？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（她的神色......她对自己的剑感到悲哀吗？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不回话吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，让我来试试，你究竟有几斤几两。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G08"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——发、发生了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我眼花了吗？赛场上突然弥漫起了黑雾——这并不罕见，但是，黑雾里出现的，是什么——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是——旗、旗帜吗？不，那是军队！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耀骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耀骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是......你的执念吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G01"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......可惜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些在观众席上远观的骑士们，是体会不到我现在的感觉的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "长旗飘扬，号角声响，一支军队......一个民族，一段历史。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——这就是你放弃当下，像个疯子一样寻死的理由吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——呵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梦魇骑士发动了袭击！但、但是黑雾笼罩着赛场，我们看不清究竟发生了什么！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是不是有什么在黑雾里前进！？难道逐魇骑士真正的法术，是召唤自己的先祖吗！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你只是缺乏直面命运的勇气罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "血骑士挥舞巨斧，他知道，他并非真的面对一支古老的怯薛军队。\n一个想要自我毁灭的年轻人。\n一个试图召回前世的年轻人。\n漆黑的雾气淹没了血骑士如血的铠甲。\n震动，疼痛，都让人明白，这些召唤物并非虚体或幻觉。\n血骑士仍旧伫立不动，他在等待，在等待梦魇本人的袭击。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（古老的语言）倒下吧，英雄！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "血骑士闷哼一声。\n即使是卡西米尔最顶级的铠甲，也在顷刻间发出哀嚎。\n刀刃劈开了铠甲，强壮如血骑士也险些单膝跪地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！伤口不够深，唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你，伤了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我的血，也抚上了你的武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（陷阱——！？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必羞耻，缺乏实战经验本来就是你的弱点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你离所谓的“怯薛”，似乎还差得很远。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G05"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你和耀骑士挡下玄铁一箭的画面，确实让人印象深刻，哪怕是银枪的天马也不可能轻易挡下玄铁的惩罚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "情报人员和我说，你们和耀骑士自称“使徒”，是一个治疗感染者的组织。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“医师”，呵，看来，我该把这个情报人员丢进钳兽笼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......很遗憾，我并不喜欢战斗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以前是个维多利亚的军人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为没有贵族身份，当不上军官，最后在联合军演上被商业联合会挖来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大概那会儿，我的上司们还在窃喜少了一个刺头吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，我对自己的射术还是很自信的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个距离，正面接下我三箭，我就放弃对罗德岛的计划，怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我如何相信你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......信不信由你，无胄盟有无数种办法对付罗德岛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比如在他们现在毫无戒心拿在手上的玩偶，涂抹上一些有挥发性的药物......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别拿这种眼神看我，安排这种事并不困难。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三箭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......三箭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第一箭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "莫妮克张弓搭箭，维多利亚最标准的姿势。\n那些在军队里的日子，年轻的莫妮克即是如此百步穿杨，深得赏识。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这一箭，太浅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "眼前的萨卡兹甚至没有拔剑。\n出乎预料的结果使莫妮克顿时感到胸中一阵闷热，不甘涌上心头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......第二箭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "再一次拉弓。\n曾在某个雨夜，莫妮克袭击了一位一阶征战骑士。\n对方不是什么名声大噪的英雄，却也是个实打实的乌卡战争老兵。\n灵敏的反应令他察觉到了暗箭，双方扭打起来，跌落山崖。\n早春的卡西米尔树林，春寒料峭，一场密林中的追逐战，持续了七天七夜。\n在四肢的疼痛和耳旁的嗡鸣声几乎到达极限的时刻，她张弓搭箭，结果了正在水源旁饮水的目标。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......姿势变了，眼神也变了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就像一个伺机待发的猎人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "被弹开的箭矢在半空中折成两节。\n一节插在地上，一节没入草坪，惊起几只闲聊的羽兽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我并不想成为猎物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......赦罪师都是你这样的剑客？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者该问，罗德岛像你这样的人有很多吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......罗德岛的风险评估是不是要重做一下......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......实话说吧，解决罗德岛是董事会的任务。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但很快，我就不再听命行动了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......实际上，我并不感到意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们的领导人，已经预见到了这一可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你想说什么？你想说这场决斗，是建立在你的自尊心上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想说......你该试着使出全力，萨卡兹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最后一箭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G01"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "结束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G08"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "绝地反击！势大力沉的一击，将萦绕赛场的黑雾彻底打散！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如同浪涛般的声势，将逐魇骑士制造的幻觉在顷刻间摧毁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "失策啊梦魇！棋差一着！面对掌握鲜血法术的血骑士，轻敌近身正是他最惨痛的失误！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那会是幻觉吗？那几乎就是......一场战争。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G01"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嘎啊......啊啊，啊啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么！？如此近距离的冲击，逐魇骑士竟然还站在赛场上！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可思议！难道他还有反击的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我是血骑士，向裁判团申请沟通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是的，他已经昏过去了，再慢会有生命危险，宣布结果吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G08"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——裁判团作出了判决！毫无疑问，卡西米尔特别锦标赛首位进军决赛的骑士已经诞生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梦魇与冠军的决斗！恐惧与恐惧的较量！已经得出了结果——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请允许我荣幸地宣布，获胜者是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在莫布宣布获胜者的姓名之前，赛场的角落，那扎眼的隔栏之后。\n有一位感染者骑士率先站了起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "血骑士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "血骑士！血骑士！血骑士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都是......感染者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G05"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "血骑士赢了！血骑士万岁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "观赛的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "血骑士！血骑士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "观赛的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "血骑士！血骑士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G01"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "血骑士！血骑士！血骑士！\n血骑士！血骑士！血骑士！\n血骑士缓缓举起了手，向观众示意。\n随后他回过头，看着仍旧没有倒下的梦魇。\n视线上抬，在梦魇的背后，极远方的观众席上，有着另一位骑士与血骑士视线相交。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G08"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耀骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G01"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G08"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "血骑士！血骑士！血骑士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（职业素养告诉我，在观众呐喊的时候我不该用麦克风插嘴，但是，好像大都是感染者......没问题吗？）"
