      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视里的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "血骑士！血骑士！血骑士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......英雄，血骑士。真是夸张的号召力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "耀骑士虽然是一个抗争的典范，但说到底，真正为感染者谋取了生存空间的，是血骑士狄开俄波利斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但是，他向我们俯首称臣已经很久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我以一介媒体从业者的身份，对你的提案深感佩服，马克维茨先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你也知道，这些......舆论只是一层软保险。想确保事情万无一失，我们得准备一些硬性措施。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是不希望所有人都......无路可退罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G07"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兴奋的观众",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
