      "text": "血骑士！血骑士赢了！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兴奋的观众",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊哈哈，我就知道血骑士是不可战胜的！血骑士是不可战胜的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兴奋的观众",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔哦，怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兴奋的观众",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那边的屋顶......升起太阳了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G05"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萨卡兹就像是忌讳自己的法术被看见一般，默默垂下了眼睑。\n短暂的光辉，如落日，依旧萦绕在萨卡兹的剑尖。\n像是想起了什么似的，萨卡兹立刻改变了持剑的姿势——将其抱入怀中。\n就好像那把剑不该出鞘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......刚才......你是怎么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是萨卡兹的巫术吗？不，但是方才我分明感到了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "生命的呼吸？不。灵魂的力量？不。\n某种更本质的，只在梦境与醉酒后的幻觉中能碰触到的无形幻象。\n但毫无疑问，这个萨卡兹方才......在挥舞晨昏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嘁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚才那一剑......你这家伙......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你本可以杀了我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是接下你三箭而已，无胄盟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，如果你食言的话，我会的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "被抓住的感觉。\n不能随意后退，会被追上......被什么追上？这个萨卡兹？还是她的剑？\n还是她所抓住的......生命的本质？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......还要继续吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "工作，也是要讲究契约精神的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "收队，停止对罗德岛一行人的跟踪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......问你一个无关紧要的问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出于对你信守承诺的尊重，我会考虑回答你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对你们萨卡兹而言，削去双角有什么......含义吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......因人而异。也许有些人认为，萨卡兹的身份本身就是诅咒，也许会通过这种方式隐藏身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者，是某些巫术的媒介，某种法术的依托。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又或者......是某些异类部族的传统。可能性有很多，但绝无定论。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不，没什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
